 friend, took a deep breath and started to feel much better. The band performance was the first event of the ceremony. The host introduced the band, and each member took their place on stage. Garcia stood at the center of the stage. As he started playing, everyone fell silent, __(E) fascinating__ by the music. Garcia's trumpet playing was flawless. When the band was finished, the audience loudly cheered. After the show, Jeff approached Garcia. \"It was fantastic. I think that was the best performance I've ever seen,\" he said. Garcia beamed with joy at his brother's praise.","_typeId":"GRAMMAR_ERROR","_typeLabel":"어법 판단","_generationPlan":"PREMIUM"},"acceptedGateIssues":[],"rejectedCandidates":[],"rejectionIssues":[],"usageEvents":[{"phase":"question_generation","subType":"GRAMMAR_ERROR","qualityMode":"strict","difficulty":"KILLER","generationPlan":"PREMIUM","usage":{"inputTokens":2290,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":2162,"cacheReadTokens":128},"outputTokens":1531,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":338,"reasoningTokens":1193},"totalTokens":3821,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":2290,"completion_tokens":1531,"total_tokens":3821,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1193},"cost":0.013574,"is_byok":false,"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.013574,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.004388,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.009186}},"reasoningTokens":1193,"cachedInputTokens":128,"costUsd":0.013574,"generationId":"gen-1784283307-NKHHfG89c6iZvajRA2ND","upstreamProvider":"xAI","servedModel":"x-ai/grok-4.5"},"provider":"atlascloud","modelId":"x-ai/grok-4.5","attempts":1,"durationMs":21438},{"phase":"question_generation","subType":"GRAMMAR_ERROR","qualityMode":"strict","difficulty":"KILLER","generationPlan":"PREMIUM","usage":{"inputTokens":4217,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":4089,"cacheReadTokens":128},"outputTokens":4877,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":1374,"reasoningTokens":3503},"totalTokens":9094,"raw