{"itemId":"pb-b-34","armId":"PROBE-B","batchId":"grok-probe-v1","frameId":"adhoc-prod-01","contentHash":"e48c24d170d33c7aa4acf82d055152cf363324a09e750a5b23142417b4e340e2","split":"adhoc","subType":"BLANK_INFERENCE","difficulty":"KILLER","plan":"PREMIUM","profile":null,"outcome":"accepted","fatalError":null,"ms":41032,"slots":1,"calls":[{"stageKey":"question.structured","purpose":"candidate","slotConsumed":true,"ok":true,"ms":20746,"usage":{"inputTokens":9208,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":9080,"cacheReadTokens":128},"outputTokens":1272,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":1272,"reasoningTokens":0},"totalTokens":10480,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":9208,"completion_tokens":1272,"total_tokens":10480,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0},"cost":0.025856,"is_byok":false,"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.025856,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.018224,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.007632}},"reasoningTokens":0,"cachedInputTokens":128,"costUsd":0.025856,"generationId":"gen-1784283442-5jwxcPfNi3OQTrE3Gam3","upstreamProvider":"xAI","servedModel":"x-ai/grok-4.5"}},{"stageKey":"question.solver","purpose":"evaluation","slotConsumed":false,"ok":true,"ms":20267,"usage":{"inputTokens":1123,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":1123,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":888,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":261,"reasoningTokens":627},"totalTokens":2011,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":1123,"completion_tokens":888,"total_tokens":2011,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":627},"cost":0.012902,"is_byok":false,"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.012902,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.002246,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.010656}},"reasoningTokens":627,"cachedInputTokens":0,"costUsd":0.012902,"generationId":"gen-1784283463-EWHf9TLPhokaB2gBQKVy","upstreamProvider":"Google AI Studio","servedModel":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview"}}],"costUsd":0.038758,"accepted":{"direction":"다음 글의 빈칸에 들어갈 말로 가장 적절한 것은?","originalExpression":"a restraint on their freedom","surroundingText":"then the law cannot be understood as a restraint on their freedom.","blankAnswerMode":"PARAPHRASE","answerLogic":"원문의 '그들의 자유에 대한 구속(a restraint on their freedom)'을, 앞선 '합리적 존재 모두가 자유로이 택할 원칙'과 조건절의 '합리적 선택과 불일치하지 않는 행위 금지' 두 근거를 묶어 '그들이 이미 승인하는 합리적 자율에 대한 장벽'이라는 동일 명제의 추상적 재진술로 옮김.","options":[{"label":"1","text":"an external curb that erodes personal liberty"},{"label":"2","text":"a guarantee confined only to peace and security"},{"label":"3","text":"a device whose sole end is moral improvement of human nature"},{"label":"4","text":"a barrier to the rational autonomy they endorse"},{"label":"5","text":"a force that equalizes citizens by suspending freedom"}],"correctAnswer":"4","wrongOptionExplanations":{"1":"자유 침해처럼 들려 매력적이나, 합리적 원칙과 일치하는 법은 자유를 '침식'하지 않는다는 결론과 정면 배치입니다.","2":"서두의 안보·평화를 빌리지만 칸트는 법이 자유까지 포함하는 근본 보장이라 했으므로 범위를 부당 축소합니다.","3":"홉스적 비관 본성론 어휘를 환기하나, 법이 본성 개선 자체를 목적으로 삼는다는 주장은 글에 없고 진보 근거와 어긋납니다.","5":"평등 구속 소재를 쓰나, 평등 적용이 자유를 유예한다는 연결은 본문에 없으며 '자유 확보' 논지를 뒤집습니다."},"explanation":"빈칸 문장은 이상적 법에 대한 논의의 결론으로, 조건이 충족될 때 법이 자유를 어떻게 위치 짓는지 확정합니다. 먼저 법이란 모든 합리적 존재가 자유로이 택할 정치 원칙의 구현이라고 했고, 이어 그런 법이 합리적 선택과 불일치하는 행위를 금하면 그 금지는 존재들의 선택 자체와 충돌하지 않는다고 했습니다. 따라서 그 법은 그들이 이미 수용하는 합리적 자율을 가로막는 장벽으로 이해될 수 없습니다. ④가 이 교차 근거를 종합한 재진술입니다. ①은 자유를 침식하는 규제라는 표현에 끌리기 쉽고, ②는 안보·평화로 범위를 좁히며, ③은 본성 개량 목적, ⑤는 평등 구속과 자유 유예를 잘못 잇는 절반진실입니다.","keyPoints":["이상적 법=합리적 존재가 자유로이 택할 원칙의 구현","합리적 선택과 합치하는 금지≠자유에 대한 구속","칸트의 법 진보 논거는 낙관적 인간본성이 아님"],"tags":["빈칸추론","KILLER","칸트","법치","자유"],"difficulty":"KILLER","passageWithBlank":"Kant staunchly advocated for the rule of law as the fundamental assurance, providing not just for security and peace, but for liberty as well.. He believed that human societies were moving towards more rational forms regulated by effective and binding legal frameworks because only such frameworks enabled people to live in harmony, to prosper and to co-operate. However, his belief in inevitable progress was not based on an optimistic or high-minded view of human nature. On the contrary, it comes close to Hobbes's outlook: man's violent and conflict-prone nature makes it necessary to establish and maintain an effective legal framework in order to secure peace. We cannot count on people's benevolence or goodwill, but even 'a nation of devils' can live in harmony in a legal system that binds every citizen equally. Ideally, the law is the embodiment of those political principles that all rational beings would freely choose. If such laws forbid them to do something that they would not rationally choose to do anyway, then the law cannot be understood as _____.","_typeId":"BLANK_INFERENCE","_typeLabel":"빈칸 추론","_generationPlan":"PREMIUM","_qualityWarnings":[{"severity":"warning","code":"blank-explanation-step-numbering","message":"Explanation may be using circled digits (①②③…) as prose structure rather than option references. Prefer 먼저/이어서/따라서 and reserve ①~⑤ for citing options."},{"severity":"warning","code":"blank-paraphrase-killer-too-easy","message":"KILLER PARAPHRASE blank is too surface-level; use a richer central relation and a correct option with enough conceptual load."},{"severity":"warning","code":"blank-killer-polarity-shortcut","message":"PARAPHRASE blank should include at least 2 negative-polarity wrong options to block polarity scanning."}]},"acceptedGateIssues":[{"severity":"warning","code":"blank-explanation-step-numbering","message":"Explanation may be using circled digits (①②③…) as prose structure rather than option references. Prefer 먼저/이어서/따라서 and reserve ①~⑤ for citing options."},{"severity":"warning","code":"blank-paraphrase-killer-too-easy","message":"KILLER PARAPHRASE blank is too surface-level; use a richer central relation and a correct option with enough conceptual load."},{"severity":"warning","code":"blank-killer-polarity-shortcut","message":"PARAPHRASE blank should include at least